{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>You shall hear a dream to interpret it.</b> You will listen and understand a dream to interpret it." "<b>You shall hear.</b> A term of understanding and listening, like ״שׁוֹמֵעַ יוֹסֵף,״ ״אֲשֶׁר לֹא תִשְׁמַע לְשֹׁנוֹ״; אנטינ\"דרא בְּלַעַ\"ז."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {1 "The la'az is Old French antandre, 'to understand/comprehend.'"}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:56.100917944Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}